---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="JT | Me" description="About JT">
  <h1>Me</h1>
  <div class="card me-content">
    <p>Hey. How's it going. I'm JT</p>
    <p>This is a picture of me.</p>
    <p>JT Baker is a composer, percussionist and teacher dedicated to writing and premiering new works that expand the sonic and expressive possibilities of percussion instruments, particularly the snare drum. His composition practice developed from his approach to learning and teaching marching snare drum. His ties to Drum Corps and the marching arts run deep through the Santa Clara Vanguard Drum and Bugle Corps (snare drummer 2022, snare technician 2024-present), the University of North Texas PASIC Snare Ensemble (performer/composer 2021, 2022), and the current national Japan tour of the original production of “Blast!” (2024, 2026) as a snare soloist. His compositions toe the line between marching arts sentiments contemporary chamber music, and improvised sound art. JT currently lives and works in Toledo, Ohio, plans to attend Bowling Green State University to pursue a Masters in Music Composition, runs a small online private lesson studio, and works as the drummer for Diet Smiles, a leftist hardcore punk band based in Toledo.</p>
    <img src="/images/birthday.webp" width="1200" height="1200" alt="JT at a birthday celebration" />
  </div>

  <style>
    .me-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(220px, 36%);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .me-content p { margin: 0; }

    .me-content img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .me-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
